<title>USA: Rehabilicare sees high growth in UK.</title>
<headline>Rehabilicare sees high growth in UK.</headline>
<dateline>NEW BRIGHTON, Minn. 1996-11-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Rehabilicare Inc said Wednesday it reached an agreement with its United Kingdom distributor for the purchase of a significant quantity of its BabiTENS product, which is used for pain management during labor and delivery.</p>
<p>The agreement enables the distributor to sell the BabiTENS through the Boots Pharmacy chain in the United Kingdom.</p>
<p>The agreement will require Rehabilicare to produce significant numbers of BabiTENS units and disposable electrodes between now and June 1997, said president David Kaysen.  &quot;It will represent over $750,000 in revenues to Rehabilicare this (fiscal) year,&quot; he said.</p>
<p>	   -- Chicago newsdesk 312 408-8787</p>
</text>
